{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志下","commonName":"歷代志下","title":"歷代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"f440330757d9f7150b4f1ee6f00c3941c1130aecd7b039c9cd6c1d71a8c2f5d6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":818},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["猶大王約坦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["約坦二十五歲登基，在耶路撒冷執政十六年。他母親叫耶路莎，是撒督的女兒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["約坦事事效法他父親烏西雅，做耶和華視為正的事，只是沒有進耶和華的殿。民眾仍繼續敗壞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["約坦建造耶和華殿的上門，大力修建俄斐勒的城牆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他還在猶大山區建造城邑，在樹林中建造營寨和瞭望塔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他與亞捫人的王交戰，打敗了他們。在以後的三年中，亞捫人每年進貢六萬八千兩銀子、小麥和大麥各二百二十萬升。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["約坦日漸強盛，因為他堅守他的上帝耶和華的道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["約坦其他的事及一切戰績和功業，都記在《以色列和猶大列王史》上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他二十五歲登基，在耶路撒冷執政十六年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["約坦與祖先同眠後，葬在大衛城。他兒子亞哈斯繼位。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}